<title>USA: Salomon Inc issues $750 mln notes due 2000.</title>
<headline>Salomon Inc issues $750 mln notes due 2000.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Salomon Inc was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER SALOMON INC</p>
<p>AMT $750 MLN	 COUPON 6.50 PCT   MATURITY 3/1/2000</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 9/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD  6.50 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 50 BPS     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
